# growth/env.example
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to growth/.env and fill in. growth/.env is gitignored by the
# repo's `.env*` rule — never commit real keys.
#
#   cp growth/env.example growth/.env
#   ./growth/preflight.sh
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Claude CLI --------------------------------------------------
# ABSOLUTE path to the claude binary. Leave unset and the pipeline will
# search the usual locations; set it to pin one.
#
# PIN THIS BEFORE YOU EVER SCHEDULE ANYTHING. The predecessor pipeline
# relied on PATH, and under launchd the PATH did not contain the binary.
# Every run failed with rc=127 for six weeks.
#
#   echo "GROWTH_CLAUDE_BIN=$(command -v claude)" >> growth/.env
#
# GROWTH_CLAUDE_BIN=/Users/ali/.local/bin/claude

# ---- OpenAI ------------------------------------------------------
# Required: TTS voiceover, Whisper caption timings, b-roll images.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional: a separate key/model for image generation. Falls back to
# OPENAI_API_KEY when unset.
# OPENAI_IMAGE_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL=gpt-image-1.5

# ---- Alerting ----------------------------------------------------
# THE ONE SETTING THAT PREVENTS A SILENT DEATH.
#
# A Slack incoming webhook, a Discord webhook, or any endpoint that
# accepts a JSON POST. Without it, failures are recorded to
# growth/state/status.md and reach nobody — which is exactly how medAI
# Times logged 44 consecutive failures unnoticed.
#
# GROWTH_ALERT_WEBHOOK=https://hooks.slack.com/services/XXX/YYY/ZZZ

# Optional second channel, needs a working `mail` command.
# GROWTH_ALERT_EMAIL=alihomaei1997@gmail.com

# ---- Watchdog ----------------------------------------------------
# growth/watchdog.sh alerts when nothing has shipped in this many days.
# At 2-3 Shorts a week, 10 days means two missed weeks.
# GROWTH_STALE_AFTER_DAYS=10

# ---- Voice -------------------------------------------------------
# OpenAI TTS voice and model for the voiceover.
# GROWTH_TTS_VOICE=onyx
# GROWTH_TTS_MODEL=tts-1-hd

# ---- Generation --------------------------------------------------
# Retries for a transient API hiccup. Not a workaround for a broken
# install — preflight catches that before any retry loop runs.
# GROWTH_CLAUDE_MAX_ATTEMPTS=3

# ---- Beats / b-roll ----------------------------------------------
# GROWTH_BEAT_MAX=8
# GROWTH_BEAT_QUALITY=medium     # low | medium | high
# GROWTH_SKIP_BEATS=0

# ---- Render ------------------------------------------------------
# Seconds the hook title card holds before fading.
# GROWTH_TITLE_HOLD_S=3.2
# Seconds into the video to grab the thumbnail frame.
# GROWTH_THUMB_FRAME_S=1.2
# Keep the ffmpeg staging directory for debugging a failed render.
# GROWTH_KEEP_TMP=0
